        "policyText": "THE WAY WE WORK\n\nOur selection\n\nWhat draws us to a design, how we check the details and how we label AI images and affiliate links.\n\nUpdated 2026-11-16\n\nA small piece can make an everyday outfit feel more like you. We introduce jewelry with a connection to Japanese craft.\n\nDesign and the making behind it\n\nWe look for colors, shapes and materials we want to wear, from wood and glass to porcelain, metal and fabric. We share what caught our eye and an idea for matching the piece with everyday clothes.\n\nDetails from official sources\n\nWe check makers and official shops, keep unanswered questions clear and update a page when we find new information.\n\nAI styling images\n\nStyling images are created with AI and labeled “AI image.”\n\nClear affiliate notices\n\nIf a link can earn a referral fee, we identify it as an affiliate link. The same care goes into our selection whether a link earns a fee or not."
